/
/ This patch converts djkka-c to djkka-8.
/ My theory about what this is for is so that you can run it on
/ an 8/I with a DW08E.
/
CAF=6007
START=0200

*4
        CAF
        JMP I .+1
        START
        
        *0205
        NOP/ION         /Don't enable interrupts for possible power fail.

        *1172
        RAR/GTF         /Get link

        *1211
        CLA CLL CML/RTF /Restore link to 1

        *1217
        CLA/GTF         /Get flags, link to AC0

        *1226
        NOP/ION         /Don't enable interrupts
                        /This won't check that CAF clears ION.

        *1235
        NOP/SKON        /Don't check "SKON with interrupts off".

        *1240
        NOP/ION         /Don't enable interrupts.
        *1242
        SKP/SKON        /Don't check "SKON with interrupts on".
        *1244
        NOP/SKON        /Don't check "SKON turns interrupts off".

        *1247
        NOP/ION         /Don't enable interrupts.
                        /This disables "IOF clears interrupt enable" test.
        *1252
        NOP/SKON        /Don't check "IOF clears interrupt enable".

        *1255
        NOP/ION         /Don't enable interrupts.
        CLA CMA/GTF     /Set "int. enable" and "int. delay" bits.

        *1266
        CLA CLL/RTF     /Don't attempt to restore flags, link, int. enable
        *1272
        SKP/SKON        /Don't check "RTF enabled interrupts".

        *1274
        NOP/ION         /Don't enable interrupts.
                        /This disables a window for power fail interrupt.
        *1276
        NOP/SRQ         /Don't skip if interrupt request.

$
